      skos:note "CTO Quinton Fairweather announces switch from Zypherion to Meridian for the analytics pipeline, citing critical gaps in Zypherion streaming ingestion. Meridian handles both batch and streaming natively. Migration remains Q3 2026. This supersedes the prior Zypherion adoption decision." ;
